---
import { Picture } from "astro:assets";
import { communityScale } from "../data/site";
import communityImage from "../assets/sitcon-2026-crew.jpg";
---
<section id="about" class="section about-section" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Since 2012 · 由學生發起</p>
        <h2 id="about-heading">這個舞台，<br />有我們一起。</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="about-copy">
        <p>從 2012 年開始，SITCON 以學生為本，持續投入資訊教育與開源精神推廣。每一場交流背後，都是願意分享所學、一起做事的人。</p>
        <p>從第一次參與，到走上講台、加入志工行列，學生的熱情在這裡匯聚，也讓知識與經驗持續傳承。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <dl class="scale-primary">
      {communityScale.primary.map(stat => (
        <div><dt>{stat.label}</dt><dd>{stat.value}<small>{stat.unit}</small></dd></div>
      ))}
    </dl>
    <div class="scale-bottom">
      <dl class="scale-secondary">
        {communityScale.secondary.map(stat => (
          <div><dt>{stat.label}</dt><dd>{stat.value}<small>{stat.unit}</small></dd></div>
        ))}
      </dl>
      <p class="source-note">{communityScale.period}<br /><a href={communityScale.source.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">資料來源：{communityScale.source.label}</a></p>
    </div>
    <figure class="community-photo">
      <Picture src={communityImage} alt="SITCON 2026 工作人員在年會現場合影" formats={["avif", "webp"]} widths={[640, 960, 1440]} sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 1280px" loading="lazy" />
      <figcaption>每一個現場，都由一群願意投入的人共同完成。<span>SITCON 2026 工作人員合影</span></figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>
